      en: ["Capital city of the Cuvette-Ouest Department in northwestern Congo.", "Located on the banks of the strategic Likouala-Mossaka River.", "The town serves as a major administrative hub for the forestry region.", "Served by Ewo Airport, which carries the IATA code EWO.", "Situated at an average elevation of approximately 400 meters.", "Located roughly 680 kilometers north of the capital city, Brazzaville."],
