      en: ["Boko serves as the administrative seat of the Boko District in the Pool Department.", "The town is located very close to the international border with the DR Congo.", "Boko is famous throughout the country for its high-quality pineapple yields.", "The local topography consists of undulating hills and exceptionally fertile soil.", "It is situated approximately 120 kilometers from the capital city, Brazzaville.", "The town acts as a major collection hub for southern agricultural exports."],
