      en: ["Louingui is the administrative capital of its namesake district.", "The town is positioned roughly halfway between Kinkala and Boko.", "The local economy is almost entirely driven by agricultural activities.", "Louingui is located in the heart of the Pool savanna eco-region.", "It is situated approximately 110 kilometers from the capital, Brazzaville.", "The town hosts a regional market specializing in local farm produce."],
